                  "text": "▪ Pneumonia is a respiratory infection of the alveolar\nspace which can vary form a mild outpatient illness to a\nsevere illness necessitating hospitalization and intensive\ncare.\n▪ Pneumonia can be generally defined as inflammation of\nthe lung parenchyma, in which consolidation of the\naffected part and filling of the alveolar air spaces with\nexudate, inflammatory cells and fibrin is characteristic."
