                  "text": "■ Peripheral neuropathy develops when nerves in the body's\nextremities, such as the hands, feet and arms, are\ndamaged. The symptoms depend on which nerves are\naffected.\nhttps://www.nhs.uk/conditions/peripheral-neuropathy/"
