                  "text": "■ The onset of dementia is most common in\nthe seventies and eighties and is quite rare\nbefore age 40.\n■ The economic burden of dementia is\nenormous, and it is expected to rise steeply\nwith anticipated demographic shifts.\n• ■ Dementia refers to cognitive impairment\nthat could originate from a variety of\nmedical and psychiatric disorders.\n■ Dementia is characterized by a disabling\ndecline in memory and impairment in at\nleast one other higher cortical activity.\n– Aphasia\n– Apraxia\n– Agnosia\n– Executive dysfunction\n– Mood and behaviors\n• Basic-ADL\nInstrument-ADL\n• แนวทางเวชปฏิบัติภาวะสมองเสื่อม (ฉบับสมบูรณ์ 2563)"
