                  "title": "Summary: DCIS",
                  "pages": "หน้า 31",
                  "text": "■ Lumpectomy\n■ Mastectomy\n■ Reconstruction\n■ Sentinel node biopsy\n■ Whole breast radiation\n■ Considered endocrine therapy\n– Tamoxifen\n– Aromatase inhibitors"
