                  "text": "■ Early invasive breast cancer\n– Locoregional treatment\n■ Lumpectomy\n■ Mastectomy\n■ Reconstruction\n– Radiation\n– Chemotherapy (neoadjuvant)\n– Endocrine therapy\n– Trastuzumab (If HER-2 positive)\n• ■ Advanced invasive breast cancer\n– Chemotherapy (adjuvant)\n– Endocrine therapy\n– Trastuzumab (If HER-2 positive)\n– Radiation\n– Locoregional treatment\n■ Lumpectomy\n■ Mastectomy\n■ Reconstruction"
