              "text": "■ Binds to and inhibits the biologic activity of\nhuman vascular endothelial growth factor\n(VEGF).\n■ Common side effects when used for cancer\ninclude nose bleeds, headache, high blood\npressure, and rash\n■ Severe side effects include gastrointestinal\nperforation, bleeding, allergic reactions, blood\nclots, and an increased risk of infection"
