              "text": "■ Molecular abnormalities in the pathogenesis of\nlung cancer\n– Aberrant promoter methylation\n– Activation of proto‐oncogenes, growth factors and\nreceptors\n– Expression of telomerase activity\n– Functional loss of tumor suppressor genes (many\nlead to increased cyclin‐dependent kinase activity\nand uncontrolled proliferation)\n– Alteration of apoptosis pathways favoring\nanti‐apoptosis\n– Potential loss of DNA repair mechanisms\nSalgia R, et al. J Clin Oncol 1998;16:1207‐1217.,\nRosell R, et al. Lung Cancer 2004;46:135‐148\n• ■ K‐ras and EGFR (HER‐1, erb‐B1)\n– K‐ras mutations\n■ EML4‐ALK\nAhrendt SA, et al. Cancer 2001;92:1525‐1560.\nEberhard DA, et al.J Clin Oncol 2005;23:5905‐5909."
