              "text": "Non-modifiable risk factors\n▪ Age\n▪ Race\n▪ Sex\n▪ Low birth weight\n▪ Genetic Factors\nModifiable, well documented\n▪ Cigarette Smoking\n▪ Hypertension\n▪ Diabetes\n▪ Asymptomatic carotid stenosis\n▪ Dyslipidemia\n▪ Atrial fibrillation\n▪ Sickle cell disease\n▪ Poor diet\n▪ Obesity\n▪ Physical inactivity\n▪ Other cardiac diseases (coronary heart disease, heart failure, PAD)\nPharmacotherapy: A Pathophysiologic Approach, 11e, 2020."
