              "text": "▪ Anabolism & Catabolism functions\n▪ Detoxification\nAnabolism Catabolism\nGlucose  =>  glycogen , fat Glycogen, FA, AA → glucose\nVital proteins (ex. albumin,transferin) Urea cycle\nCoagulation factor Hb => bilirubin\nInactive Vit.D => 25-OH cholecalciferol Eliminate various hormone"
