              "title": "Naltrexone",
              "pages": "หน้า 12",
              "text": "▪ Extensive first hepatic metabolism with oral\nbioavailability of 5-40%\n▪ Recommended dose is 50 mg/day for 12 weeks\n▪ ADRs\n▪ GI problems (nausea, vomiting, abdominal pain)\n▪ CNS-related symptoms (headache and fatigue)"
