              "title": "Drug used in Parkinson’s",
              "pages": "หน้า 15",
              "text": "■ L-DOPA\n■ AAAD or DDC inhibitors\n– Carbidopa, Benseraside\n■ COMT inhibitors\n– Entacapone, Tolcapone\n■ MOA-B inhibitors\n■ Dopamine agonists\n■ Anticholinergic drugs\n■ Amantadine\nAAAD =  Aromatic L-amino acid decarboxylase\nDDC = Dopamine decarboxylase"
