              "text": "World Wide Wound. Teaching wound management: a collaborative model for future education; [cite 16 Aug 2025]. Available form:\nhttp://www.worldwidewounds.com/2005/november/Watret/Teaching-Wound-Mgt-Collaborative-Model.html\n• ■ TIME(S) model\n• ■ NICE model\n– N Necrotic tissue\n– I Infection\n– C Characteristics\n– E Exudate"
