              "text": "■ Serotonin and norepinephrine reuptake inhibitors\n■ MOA : block 5-HT and NE reuptake transporter\n■ Venlafaxine, duloxetine\n■ PK : venlafaxine is metabolized by CYP 2D6 to active\nmetabolite (O -desmethylvenlafaxine; ODV), then\nexcreted in renal\n■ Duloxetine is CYP 2D6 inhibitor (mild to moderate)\n• Drugs Note\nVenlafaxine\n(EFFEXOR®)\nDesvenlafaxine\n• Low dose : inhibit 5-HT reuptake\n• High dose: inhibit 5-HT, NE reuptake\n• Desvenlafexine = active metabolite of\nVenlafaxine\nDuloxetine All dose can inhibit both 5-HT and NE\nreuptake"
