              "pages": "หน้า 93",
              "text": "Atherosclerotic Cardiovascular Disease (ASCVD)\nDefined as acute coronary syndromes (ACSs), a history\nof myocardial infarction (MI), stable or unstable angina,\ncoronary or other arterial revascularization, stroke, transient\nischemic attack, or peripheral arterial disease presumed to\nbe of atherosclerotic origin\nHeart failure (HF)\nChronic kidney disease (CKD)"
