              "text": "■ Systemic lupus erythematosus (SLE) is an\nautoimmune disease associated with\nautoantibody production\n■ SLE is generally considered to occur most\nfrequently in women of reproductive age\n■ The exact etiology for SLE is unknown\n■ Predisposing factors: Genetic, hormone,\ncigarette smoke, Ultraviolet light, Infection\n(Epstein-Barr virus: EBV) , Psychological stress\nCOPYRIGHT © PAHRMA PLUS  ALL RIGHTS RESERVED"
