              "text": "■ Nonspecific or Innate mechanism\n■ Specific or Adaptive mechanism\nRef: www.pinterest.com\n• Klaassen CD, editors. Casarett & Doulls toxicology the basic science of poisons. 7th  ed. McGraw-Hill; 2008."
